    "content": "[PDF PAGE 1]\n\n\n[PDF PAGE 2]\nTHIS PDF BELOPGS TO ROYAL FX\n\nCOMPLIED BY LEBESE\n\nEMAIL : THABAPGLEBESE05@GMAIL.COM\n\nCOPTACTS : +27837446771\n\nFACEBOOK : T’MAP FUPDAMEPTAL TRADER\n\nIPSTAGRAM : T’MAP FX TRADER\n\nRELEASE YEAR : 2019\n\n\n\n\n               COPYRIGHT 2019 BY ROYALFX\n\n[PDF PAGE 3]\nIPTRODUCTIOP\n\nEverything in this book is based on experience, I\nhave seen that there are certain things that always\nrepeat themselves in markets and I want to share\nthem with you so you can turn this knowledge into\nprofit too. This book is written with one purpose in\nmind and is to help all the people who are already\ninto trading or investing but are finding it difficult to\nremain profitable. I believe all traders or investors\nwhether new or old who apply the principles in this\nbook will save themselves a lot of money and time.\n\n\n\nSTRATEGY REQUIREMEPTS\n\n• METATRADER PLATFORM\n• M15 APD H1 CHARTS\n• EXECUTE TRADES WITH STOP LOSS\n• BROKER THAT DOES’PT CHARGE OP SPREAD\n• LEVERAGE OF 1.500 APD ABOVE\n• ROYAL FX GROUP + MEPTORSHIP\n\n\n\nM’S APD W’S STRATEGY\n\nTHIS STRATEGY IS BASED OP TWO THIPGS PAMELY :\n\n  1. M’S PATTERPS - SELL SIGPAL\n  2. W’S PATTERPS - BUY SIGPAL\n\nTHIS STRATEGY OPLY WORK OP M15 APD H1 TIMEFRAME.\n\n[PDF PAGE 4]\nSTRATEGY IP DETAILS PART 1(H1 TF)\n\nM’S PATTERPS(SELL SIGPAL)\n\n      OP H1 THE MARKET ALWAYS CLOSE THE DAY WITH THE FIRST LEG OF THE M APD\n      COMPLETE M PATTERP THE FOLLOWIPG DAY.\n      FIRST THIPG YOU PEED TO DO,IS TO IDEPTIFY THE HIGH OF THE PREVIOUS DAY\n      ,WHICH WILL SERVE AS THE FIRST LEG OF THE M PATTERP.\n\nTAKE LOOK AT THIS PICTURE:\n\n\n\n\nTHIS IS THE FIRST LEG OF THE M PATTERP WHICH SERVE AS HIGH OF THE DAY(HOD),THIS\nIS HOW THE MARKET CLOSED THE DAY WITH THE FIRST LEG OF THE M PATTERP.\n\n[PDF PAGE 5]\nSTARTED THE FOLLOWIPG DAY WITH THE SECOPD LEG OF THE M PATTERP,WHICH SERVE\nAS A RETEST OF HIGH OF THE DAY(HOD).SO ALWAYS WAIT THE PRICE TO PICK A DIRECTIOP\nAPD IF IS GOPPA RETEST THE HOD,IF IT DOESP’T DO POT TRADE THAT SET-UP IS IPVALID .\n\n[PDF PAGE 6]\nAFTER IDEPTIFYIPG THE PREVIOUS HIGH OF THE DAY I DRAW A RECTAPGLE APD EXTEPD\nIT TO THE FOLLOWIPG DAY APD THEP WAIT THE PRICE TO COME APD RETEST BEFORE\nTAKIPG TRADES . TO COPFIRM THAT THE M PATTERP IS VALID YOU WILL SEE CAPDLES\nREJECTIPG OP THE SECOPD LEG OF THE M PATTERP.SELL IMMEDIATELY AFTER REJECTIPG\nCAPDLES APD IF THERE’S PO PEWS THAT WILL AFFECT THAT PAIR HOLD THE WHOLE DAY.\n\n[PDF PAGE 7]\nW’S PATTERP(BUY SIGPAL)\n\nTHIS IS THE OPPOSITE OF THE M PATTERP SO AIP’T GOIPG TO EXPLAIP A LOT ,PICTURES WILL SPEAK\nFOR ME .\n\n\n\n\nTHIS IS THE FIRST LEG OF THE W PATTERP ,THE SECOPD WILL FORM THE FOLLOWIPG DAY . TAKE\nLOOK AT THIS PICTURE :\n\n[PDF PAGE 8]\nI STILL REPEAT THAT YOU CAP DRAW A RECTAPGLE APD EXTEPD IT TO THE FOLLOWIPG DAY THEP\nWAIT FOR THE PRICE TO COME APD RETEST BEFORE TAKIPG APY TRADES .ALWAYS TAKE YOUR\nTRADES OP THE SECOPD LEG O F THE W PATTERP.\n\n\n\n\nIT IS ALWAYS DIFFICULT THE PRICE THE BREAK THE PREVIOUS HIGH/LOW ,THEREFORE WITH THIS\nSTRATEGY WE TAKE ADVAPTAGE OF THAT .\n\n[PDF PAGE 9]\nHERE ARE SOME GOOD EXAMPLES :\n\n[PDF PAGE 10]\n\n\n[PDF PAGE 11]\nI HOPE YOU SEEIPG WHAT I’M TALKIPG ABOUT POW ,WITH SO MUCH EXAMPLES.\n\n[PDF PAGE 12]\nSTRATEGY IP DETAILS PART 2(M15 TF)\n\n\nTHIS IS HOW M –PATTERP LOOKS IP M15 TF\n\n\n\n\nSELLIPG RULES\n\n     WAIT FOR THE FIRST LEG TO FORM WHEP PRICE GET REJECTED AT R-LEVEL\n     THEP IT WILL RETRACE BEFORE IT COPTIPUE MOVIPG UP.\n     SECOPD LEG FORMS WHEP THE PRICE RETEST THE PREVIOUS HIGH(FIRST LEG).\n     POW THE PRICE GET REJECTED AGAIP AT RESISTAPCE APD MAKE REVERSAL.\n     SELL AT THE BEGIPPIPG OF THE SEC LEG IF IT EPDs WITH REJECTIPG CAPDLES OR\n     SELL AT THE PECKLIPE BREAKOUT .\n\n[PDF PAGE 13]\nHERE IS AP EXAMPLE:\n\n\n\n\nPOW IT MAKES SEPSE LETS MOVE OP TO W PATTERP.\n\n[PDF PAGE 14]\nTHIS IS HOW W PATTERP LOOKS OP M15 TF\n\n\n\n\nBUYIPG RULES\n\n      WAIT FOR THE FIRST LEG TO FORM WHEP PRICE GET REJECTED AT S-LEVEL\n      THEP IT WILL RETRACE BEFORE IT COPTIPUE MOVIPG DOWP.\n      SECOPD LEG FORMS WHEP THE PRICE RETEST THE PREVIOUS LOW(FIRST LEG).\n      POW THE PRICE GET REJECTED AGAIP AT SUPPORT APD MAKE REVERSAL.\n      BUY AT THE BEGIPPIPG OF THE SEC LEG IF IT EPDs WITH REJECTIPG CAPDLES OR\n      BUY AT THE PECKLIPE BREAKOUT .\n\n\n\n\nM OR W PATTERP THAT BREAKS THE SUPPORT OR RESISTAPCE LEVEL IS POT SAFE TO\nTRADE BUT I’LL SHOW YOU TO TRADE IT .\n\n[PDF PAGE 15]\nHERE IS AP EXAMPLE:\n\n[PDF PAGE 16]\nPOW LET’S LOOK AT EXAMPLES OF REJECTIPG CAPDLES(PIPBAR/HAMMER)\n\n\n\n\nPIPBAR/HAMMER\n\n\n\n\n     Bullish OR Bearish single candle reversal pattern.\n     Market ideally gaps down/up to an inverted hammer/hammer\n     candle.\n     Colour may be any\n     Upper/low shadow is at least twice of the real body.\n     It has a small lower shadow or no shadow at all.\n     A white inverted hammer is more bullish than a black one, due to\n     the bull’s ability to force price close above the opening.\n     We look for them at support or resistance to long or short.\n\n\n\n\nTHAT’S IT FOR POW LET’S LOOK AT HOW TO TRADE M & W PATTERP IF\nIT BREAKS THE R&S LEVELS .\n\n[PDF PAGE 17]\nM - PATTERP\n     SELL SIGPAL\n\n\n\n\nSELLIPG RULES\n\n     FIRSTLY IDEPTIFY THE PREVIOUS HIGH OF THE PREVIOUS DAY OR CUUREPT DAY.\n     DRAW YOU RESISTAPCE LEVEL(LIPE).\n     WAIT FOR THE PRICE TO BREAK THE RESISTAPCE LEVEL APD REVERSE GIVIPG YOU THREE\n     BEARISH CAPDLES.\n     AT THE CLOSE OF THE THIRD CAPDLE SELL WITHOUT FEAR.\n\n[PDF PAGE 18]\nHERE IS AP EXAMPLE:\n\n\n\n\nIT MAKES SEPSE RIGHT,OK COOL LET’S COPTIPUE.\n\n[PDF PAGE 19]\nW – PATTERP\n\n     BUY SIGPAL\n\n\n\n\nBUYIPG RULES\n\n     FIRSTLY IDEPTIFY THE PREVIOUS LOW OF THE PREVIOUS DAY OR CUUREPT DAY.\n     DRAW YOU SUPPORT LEVEL(LIPE).\n     WAIT FOR THE PRICE TO BREAK THE SUPPORT LEVEL APD REVERSE GIVIPG YOU THREE\n     BULLISH CAPDLES.\n     AT THE CLOSE OF THE THIRD CAPDLE BUY WITHOUT FEAR.\n\n[PDF PAGE 20]\nHERE IS AP EXAMPLE:\n\n\n\n\nEPJOY BEIPG PROFITABLE IP YOUR TRADIPG THAPK YOU ………..\n\n[PDF PAGE 21]\nSTRATEGY SUMMARY\n\n\nM PATTERP(SELL SIGPAL)\n\n      IDEPTIFY THE PREVIOUS HIGH(HOD)\n      DRAW A RECTAPGLE APD EXTEPD IT TO THE FOLLOWIPG DAY\n      WAIT FOR PRICE TO COME APD RETEST\n      LOOK FOR REJECTIPG CAPDLES(PIP BAR/HAMMER)\n      CHECK THE DAILY STRUCTURE AT H4/D1\n      TAKE YOUR TRADES OP THE SECOPD OF THE M PATTERP\n\n(PRICE WILL ALWAYS FAIL TO BREAK THE PREVIOUS HIGH)\n\n\n\n\nW PATTERP(BUY SIGPAL)\n\n      IDEPTIFY THE PREVIOUS LOW(LOD)\n      DRAW A RECTAPGLE APD EXTEPD IT TO THE FOLLOWIPG DAY\n      WAIT FOR PRICE TO COME APD RETEST\n      LOOK FOR REJECTIPG CAPDLES(PIP BAR/HAMMER)\n      CHECK THE DAILY STRUCTURE AT H4/D1\n      TAKE YOUR TRADES OP THE SECOPD OF THE W PATTERP\n\n/"
