    "content": "[PDF PAGE 1]\nPRICE ORDER DELIVERY AND OBSERVATION\n\n                      Think of it as a business, anyway it is a business…\n\n\n\nDelivery - the act of bringing goods/money (ORDER FLOW VOLUMES) to a particular\nregion/zones by the BFI ( banks and financial institutions) to fulfill their intentions. It is\nvisible to us in the form of charts price vs time.\n\nObservation - The action or process of closely observing or monitoring Price. This is\nwatching how price is being delivered from one BFI Initiation to another without having\nany BIAS on the direction. In this concept we are training our subconscious to see the\nrepetitive moves in the market and reprogramme our subconscious to remove market\nBIAS learnt either from previous strategy or market experience ( ORDER FLOW)\n\nPrice Delivery Forms Market Structure. Observing Price Delivery Is Watching the Market\nStructure form by trend or sideway delivery.\n\nHow do we observe price delivery?\nThis is a very important aspect as understanding price delivery will let you execute a\nposition effortlessly without any fear of loss or FOMO. You will monitor how price reaches\nand reacts around your POI/AOI/ZONE/OBs or whatever you call it and try to understand\nWHY, why it reacted and initiated or reacted but gave no follow through . We observe\ndelivery by monitoring price through a multi-time frame, and analysing how cau$e is being\nbuilt to support BFI intentions.\n\nComponents of price delivery\n\nSideways Price Delivery / Range\n\nStacking- BFI’s are ‘’STACKING’’ orders when playing in a prolonged range, price kept\nbetween two price levels, they’re accumulating orders (from both sell side and buy side).\ntheir aim is to accumulate enough orders to support their next big move (initiation).\nStacking is the ‘’cau$e’’ for the order flow.\n\nTrend Delivery\n\nOrder flow - (mitigation to mitigation) a fast impulsive move in price action then a short\npause ( small range) then another Impulse in price in the same direction, be it a bullish or\nbearish.\n\n[PDF PAGE 2]\nQUESTIONS TO ASK YOURSELF WHILE OBSERVING.\nWhat has happened? Why did it happen ? what is happening?, why is it happening?\n\nhttps://www.tradingview.com/x/lseirmFS/\n\n\n\n\nhttps://www.tradingview.com/x/1ytTOGEv/\n\n[PDF PAGE 3]\nhttps://www.tradingview.com/x/6jbfcctR/"
